my name is Gregg Gonsalves.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.680
I am an Assistant Professor at the

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.969
Yale School of Public Health.

00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:15.620
Welcome this evening
to our second town hall

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.340
